Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: PadTV Project <padtv@localhost>
Depends: padtv-core (>= 0.3.3), calamares, polkitd, pkexec, qt6-wayland, grub-pc-bin, grub-efi-amd64-bin, grub2-common, efibootmgr, dosfstools, squashfs-tools, rsync, util-linux-extra, console-setup
Description: Graphical disk installer for PadTV System Core
